  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T21:07:38.995700Z",
  "totalBlocks": 34,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e888a199bdbf7301",
      "translationZh": "终于完成了我的分支版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "043c69ac49126605",
      "translationZh": "我还想添加或尝试的其他东西，目前都无法正常工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76c46246cf7123c6",
      "translationZh": "带宽自适应的 CPU/GPU 执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee3f7abc7b38ab32",
      "translationZh": "将 https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.16157 中共享专家驻留的思路整合到了这个分支的性能分析器、有界缓存和混合执行工作中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec905727e0a0dce3",
      "translationZh": "这是针对 ik_llama 的调度器和量化内核所做的适配，并非 FreeToken 的完整实现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ced2ea324d8e574",
      "translationZh": "jadidbourbaki 的 n-gram 缓存优化：https://github.com/jadidbourbaki/llama.cpp/pull/2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1ce2f8d2b0b33db",
      "translationZh": "支持 Q2_0，主要是为了让这样的模型能够运行：https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-Coder-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4856ac6f85fdfce",
      "translationZh": "可配置的专家驻留显存上限：--moe-resident-mib N",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c2ac6049e2e0ddd",
      "translationZh": "实验性驻留选项：--moe-resident-profiler old/new --moe-resident-grouping off/layout",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e35000e982e0e23f",
      "translationZh": "我不知道 -ncmoe 的表现如何，因为我无法在自己的硬件上对它进行充分测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56a3d9e0baaf820a",
      "translationZh": "如果不指定 --moe-resident-mib N，--moe-resident auto 会用驻留专家填满所有可用的空闲 VRAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5b6330477fd92ae",
      "translationZh": "你可以限制驻留缓存使用的 VRAM 容量，有意留出一些空闲空间。设置一个合适的容量上限有助于提升速度。如果把上限设得太低，性能也会下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32c50d7e53c52b14",
      "translationZh": "然后，见证生成速度提升的魔法吧，哈哈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34db56a7fbf5dd5d",
      "translationZh": "重点是：只有当完整的 MoE 无法装入 VRAM，并且 GPU 仍有未利用的计算能力、PCI 总线仍有空闲带宽时，这才有帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4c5c52b9be0d7fe",
      "translationZh": "如果你的 GPU 原本就已经满载，这个分支可能不会带来任何改善。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "133050b4938fd383",
      "translationZh": "如果你的 GPU 利用率徘徊在 ~75%，而 VRAM 中已经放了很多层，那么可以尝试将常规 GPU 层数减少 1-2 层，并使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edf539039e453f29",
      "translationZh": "根据你的 GPU 和可用 VRAM 调整上限。目标是利用常驻专家来填补原本闲置的 GPU 算力，而不是单纯让完全卸载到 GPU 的层数最大化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3f0bd0eeaf77236",
      "translationZh": "我的配置是 RTX 2060 6GB + Ryzen 7 2700X + 40 GB DDR 4 2993Mhz，使用 arch；VRAM 太少，无法将足够多的完整专家层卸载到 GPU 来获得有效加速，所以我使用 -cmoe。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95ff9672091744e5",
      "translationZh": "在这些改动之前，生成时我的 GPU 利用率可能只有约 25-35%，VRAM 仍有大约 1.5-2GB 空闲，而 cpu 已经满载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "688730f505f5034a",
      "translationZh": "使用 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_M.gguf、上下文长度约为 15-30k 时，默认的 ik_llama.cpp 能给我大约 23 t/s，而这个分支能达到约 26-30 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9f01dc899a5cbd8",
      "translationZh": "所以，在我的硬件上，我观察到了大约 20-30% 的速度提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a92ede44d2b9198",
      "translationZh": "GPU 更好、VRAM 更多的用户可能会获得更好的结果，具体取决于他们的瓶颈在哪里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "775d93103c04abdc",
      "translationZh": "这两个实验性选项仍需要更多测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20042ae4e94886f6",
      "translationZh": "让我获得了更均衡的 CPU/GPU 工作分配，留在 CPU 上的工作稍多一些，GPU 负载也更低，但在我的配置上，速度没有明显差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb02de6e58e9d804",
      "translationZh": "也需要更多测试，尤其是在配置更好的系统上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "113eff584e6f804b",
      "translationZh": "我有时会看到这些选项带来约 1-2 t/s 的差异，但在我的 PC 上，浏览器标签页打个喷嚏都能造成 +/-2-4 t/s 的波动，所以我不认为这能得出确切结论。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1984e3e89b2c29e0",
      "translationZh": "我计划让这个 fork 持续与 ik_llama.cpp 主分支保持同步更新，供自己使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83b20d8727919122",
      "translationZh": "如果有更多人测试它并提供反馈，尤其是在模型仍无法完全装入 VRAM 的系统上，我最终可能会提交一个 PR，将它合并到上游。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d80d6b62b7dad54a",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/IceFog72 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
